**Blocking decision:** the indexed path at the route start submits about 312,068 triangles against the 2,000,000 floor in the PRD contract. The measured frame budget also fails: p99 is 35–47 ms against 16.7 ms. The instances are seeded uniformly over 8192 m, so the start pose sees roughly 330 items. Two ways forward:

